            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "トレーナーさん。聞いてくださる？\r\n私、明日テストがありますの。",
            "enText": "Trainer, do you have a minute? \nThing is, I have a test tomorrow.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
