        },
        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "そして本日、テスト範囲を間違えて\r\n勉強していたということに気づきましたわ。",
            "enText": "But today, I realized that I messed up, \nand the material I've been studying \nwon't be on the test.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 4769845539184041436,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "ならばこれからどうすべきか、\r\nもうおわかりですわよね？",
            "enText": "So you know what I have to do now, right?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 1657063590076652764,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カワカミプリンセス",
            "enName": "Kawakami Princess",
            "jpText": "そうっ！　ぶっつけ本番に向け心を整える！\r\nそれだけですわぁ～～ッッ！！",
            "enText": "Yep! Go right into the test with \nno preparation! Problem solved!!",
